I definitions.inc

# merge 零动作路径：真正分叉但唯一文件两边改成相同内容，
# 净改动为空，提交报错且不产生新 commit
> init
<<<
+ same.txt mbase.txt
> add same.txt
<<<
> commit "base"
<<<
> branch other
<<<

# current 侧改成新版本
+ same.txt msame.txt
> add same.txt
<<<
> commit "current edit"
<<<

# given 侧也改成同一新版本
> checkout other
<<<
+ same.txt msame.txt
> add same.txt
<<<
> commit "given edit"
<<<

> checkout master
<<<
> merge other
No changes added to the commit.
<<<

# 没有新 commit：head 仍是 current edit
> log
===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
current edit

===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
base

===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
initial commit

<<<*
